-- Crop Sown Registry — sample crop sown records (local / demo only).
--
-- The platform db-seed's load_sample_data.py is shaped for the reference
-- (farmer) registry, so LOAD_SAMPLE_DATA stays false for this variant and this
-- sample set is applied explicitly instead (see docker-compose.yml).
--
-- Farmers are identified, not stored: each crop sown record carries the
-- farmer's ids and name, and mirrors the Fayda FAN into link_foundational_id.
--
-- Land is likewise not a register: a crop sown record covers exactly one plot,
-- whose attributes and geometry sit flat on the record. land_uuid is normally
-- generated by the ORM; these rows spell it out so the crop lines in
-- 20_crop_lines.sql can reference a known value.
--
-- Note cs0001 and cs0003 are the same farmer on two different plots: one record
-- per plot is what "land is flat on the record" means.

